Widow's solo movie almost ended with her returning

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.150
from the dead.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.919
Thanks for watching and see ya next time.

00:08:25.919 --> 00:08:27.389
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers!

